# "type": RESOLVED | UPDATE | INVESTIGATING | IDENTIFIED

### POST Add an Event
POST http://localhost:4000/api/status/events
Authorization: {{AUTH_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "identifier": "testy",
  "title": "testy",
  "description": "testy",
  "type": "INVESTIGATING",
  "date": "2026-11-18T22:00:00Z",
  "incident_identifier": "testy",
  "monitors": [
    "testy"
  ]
}

### GET Get all Events
GET http://localhost:4000/api/status/events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json


### GET Get an Event
GET http://localhost:4000/api/status/events/testy
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### POST Update an Event
POST http://localhost:4000/api/status/events/testy
Authorization: {{AUTH_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "identifier": "testy",
  "title": "testy",
  "description": "HELLO",
  "type": "UPDATE",
  "date": "2026-11-18T22:00:00Z",
  "incident_identifier": "testy",
  "monitors": ["testy"]
}

### DELETE an Event
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/status/events/testy
Authorization: {{AUTH_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
